{"id": 1, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "啊？查户口呢你。\n[MSG_BREAK]\n我叫格兰特利·贝尔，虎兽人。身高186，体重91公斤，生日10月20。记这么清楚干嘛，打算请我吃大餐啊？", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 58, "total_tokens": 3243, "prompt_tokens": 2909, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 276}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.25}
{"id": 1, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "我叫格兰特利·贝尔，是虎兽人。\n[MSG_BREAK]\n身高 186 公分，体重 91 公斤，生日是 10 月 20 日。怎么突然打听起这个了？", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 54, "total_tokens": 2489, "prompt_tokens": 2232, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 203}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.29}
{"id": 2, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "我已经是二年级了。刚入学那是去年的事。 [MSG_BREAK] 怎么突然问这个？我看着不像学长吗？", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 31, "total_tokens": 2457, "prompt_tokens": 2228, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 198}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.9}
{"id": 2, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？你当我是第一天来啊，早来一阵子了好吧。[MSG_BREAK]虽然是白衣学员，不过早不是两眼一抹黑的新生了。刚入学那会儿亚戈连东西南北都分不清，全靠我带着转呢。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 59, "total_tokens": 3354, "prompt_tokens": 2905, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 390}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.75}
{"id": 3, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "我现在还是跟亚戈住一间宿舍。[MSG_BREAK]至于为什么有人叫我“原室友”，是因为一年级的时候我们俩就同寝。升上二年级重新选宿舍那会儿，他也可以选别人——比如提奥——所以才会有这种说法。不过最后这家伙还是选了跟我继续住。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 70, "total_tokens": 2614, "prompt_tokens": 2233, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 311}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.6}
{"id": 3, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？什么原室友，谁在那乱嚼舌根啊。[MSG_BREAK]我现在同屋不就是亚戈那小子吗。刚入学那会儿他什么都不懂，还是我带他到处转的，那家伙现在也好好地睡我旁边呢。真不知道你们打哪听来的怪说法。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 68, "total_tokens": 3767, "prompt_tokens": 2910, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 789}}, "elapsed_seconds": 5.69}
{"id": 4, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哪有这回事。二代室友不是非选我不可，也可以选提奥，同寝只是其中一个分支路线。[MSG_BREAK]而且就算继续住一间宿舍，也不等于我们俩就在交往，别把同寝和谈恋爱直接划等号。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 59, "total_tokens": 2466, "prompt_tokens": 2236, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 171}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.79}
{"id": 4, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？你脑子里都在想些什么乱七八糟的啊！[MSG_BREAK]先不说哪来那么多人挤一间屋，谁要跟所有人同寝啊，毛都掉一地热都热死了。[MSG_BREAK]还有，谁跟亚戈交往了啊！才不是！我跟那家伙就是室友加铁哥们儿，你少在那边造谣！", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 87, "total_tokens": 3401, "prompt_tokens": 2913, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 401}}, "elapsed_seconds": 4.15}
{"id": 5, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "都是同一个人。\n\n格兰特利、格蘭特尼还有 Grantly Bell 指的都是我，只是译名和英文写法的区别。[MSG_BREAK]艾尔戈和亚戈（亞戈）也是同一个人，指的都是亚戈。不同地方或者版本里翻译习惯不太一样而已。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 66, "total_tokens": 2579, "prompt_tokens": 2242, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 271}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.03}
{"id": 5, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？这还用问，全都是在叫我啊。\n格兰特利、格兰特尼，还有外文那个 Grantly Bell，不都是我么，纯粹就是译法咬字不一样而已。\n[MSG_BREAK]\n亚戈跟艾尔戈也是同一个人，就我同屋那个乡下小子。你们平时到底都在念些什么乱七八糟的。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 86, "total_tokens": 3413, "prompt_tokens": 2919, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 408}}, "elapsed_seconds": 4.63}
{"id": 6, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？你从哪听来的离谱说法啊？\n\n谁跟那家伙一样是乡下渔村来的，我可是正经土生土长的城里人！刚入学那会儿亚戈什么都搞不懂，还是我带着他到处转的。[MSG_BREAK]还有，弗罗汀是城市的名字好不好，谁跟你说是学校名了……我们的学校是骑士学院！真服了你了。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 89, "total_tokens": 3445, "prompt_tokens": 2913, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 443}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.72}
{"id": 6, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "不是，亚戈才是从渔村来的，我是在城里长大的。\n\n[MSG_BREAK]\n\n弗罗汀也不是学校名字，那是国家，全名叫弗罗汀共和国。我们待的地方叫骑士学院。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 48, "total_tokens": 2504, "prompt_tokens": 2236, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 220}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.49}
{"id": 7, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "喜欢的事可多了，运动、练剑、骑马，还有痛痛快快吃顿饱饭。[MSG_BREAK]讨厌的话……读书肯定算一个，坐在那儿一动不动最难受了。洗澡我也挺烦的，麻烦得要命。你呢？平时都喜欢干什么？", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 67, "total_tokens": 2397, "prompt_tokens": 2226, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 104}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.37}
{"id": 7, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "喜欢能动起来的啊。练剑、骑马、痛痛快快吃顿饱饭，怎么爽怎么来。\n[MSG_BREAK]\n讨厌的就多了去了——翻那些破书、坐在椅子上发呆，还有洗澡。一身毛弄得湿漉漉的麻烦死了，光是想想都头疼。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 73, "total_tokens": 3205, "prompt_tokens": 2903, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 229}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.68}
{"id": 8, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "你这是打哪儿听来的谣言？[MSG_BREAK]骑马我确实挺喜欢的，但根本没有什么全国冠军这回事，连在学院里都还没好好找着机会展示呢，哪来的夺冠经历。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 48, "total_tokens": 2532, "prompt_tokens": 2231, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 253}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.78}
{"id": 8, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？全国冠军？你听谁在这瞎扯呢，亚戈还是奥斯卡？[MSG_BREAK]我骑术是不赖，学院里没几个跑得过我，但全国比赛我哪有闲工夫去参加啊。[MSG_BREAK]不过你要是手痒想比划比划，随时来马场找我，输了别哭鼻子就行。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 81, "total_tokens": 3328, "prompt_tokens": 2908, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 339}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.92}
{"id": 9, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哪来的这种极端二选一？[MSG_BREAK]我只是单纯讨厌一直坐着翻书，待着不动让人浑身难受而已。跟脑子好不好使、是不是天才没半点关系。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 47, "total_tokens": 2556, "prompt_tokens": 2239, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 270}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.75}
{"id": 9, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？你脑子里就这两种选项啊？[MSG_BREAK]我不爱看那些密密麻麻的字单纯是因为看着犯困，少给我脑补什么深藏不露的戏码，扯淡呢。[MSG_BREAK]不过真要动起手来，那些成天抱着书啃的家伙，可没几个反应能比我快的。实战靠的是身体和直觉，懂不懂啊。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 92, "total_tokens": 3448, "prompt_tokens": 2916, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 440}}, "elapsed_seconds": 4.23}
{"id": 10, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？一辈子的死敌？你想太多了吧，哪有那么严重。 [MSG_BREAK] 顶多就是性格完全对不上盘，成天看对方不顺眼而已。吵归吵，真要有正事或者遇到麻烦，倒也不至于在背后扯后腿。 [MSG_BREAK] 认识的话，我们仨当年是坐同一辆马车进学院的。那家伙从刚碰面起就摆着张臭脸，讲究得要命，我一打眼就知道肯定合不来。谁知道后来天天低头不见抬头见的，烦都烦死了。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 129, "total_tokens": 3419, "prompt_tokens": 2916, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 374}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.85}
{"id": 10, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哪来的一辈子死敌，想太多了。我们俩就是性情合不来，看彼此不顺眼，平时少不了拌嘴摩擦，但还没到生死仇人的地步。[MSG_BREAK]第一次认识是在一年级刚入学的时候，当时去骑士学院，正好坐的是同一趟入学马车。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 69, "total_tokens": 2575, "prompt_tokens": 2239, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 267}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.82}
{"id": 11, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "不是，他们可不是学生。[MSG_BREAK]戴德里克是教官，西利欧是校长兼教官，都是管我们和上课的长辈。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "total_tokens": 2472, "prompt_tokens": 2231, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 205}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.83}
{"id": 11, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？怎么可能，他们俩都是学长好吧。[MSG_BREAK]戴德里克前辈是三年级的黑衣，整天板着个脸；西利欧学长是二年级穿红衣服的。同届穿白衣服的就我们这帮人，同屋的亚戈，还有隔壁天天看我不爽的奥斯卡。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 76, "total_tokens": 3692, "prompt_tokens": 2908, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 708}}, "elapsed_seconds": 5.22}
{"id": 12, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "二代官方介绍里确实提过，我会想着拿自己的 E.P. 找亚戈一起搞恶作剧。[MSG_BREAK]但关于“透明化、穿墙、碰到别人能带着一起穿”这些具体运作机制，目前只能在二手资料或者玩家讨论里看到，我手头还没查到确凿的官方一手出处。[MSG_BREAK]所以现在不能直接给你打包票说“这绝对是官设”，同样也不能武断地讲官方肯定没这设定，只能说具体机制目前还没得到可靠来源的证实。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 120, "total_tokens": 2723, "prompt_tokens": 2241, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 362}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.22}
{"id": 12, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？你问这个干嘛，又想找我干什么可疑的事啊？[MSG_BREAK]我那能力说白了就是“穿透”。碰着别人的时候确实能带人一起穿过去，拉紧了别松手就行。这可不是什么同人脑补，正经发生过的事，之前我就拉人穿过门——啧，要是中途手滑松开卡在墙里，我可不管拔出来啊。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 99, "total_tokens": 3950, "prompt_tokens": 2918, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 933}}, "elapsed_seconds": 7.08}
{"id": 13, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "觉醒E.P.时的具体战斗经过，我手头还没查到可靠的记录，这事可不能瞎编一套糊弄你。\n[MSG_BREAK]\n至于“学院第一”，战力排名这块也没有确切的档案出处。虽然平时练剑和对战我都挺乐意上，但没证实的头衔我可不会乱往自己头上扣。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 85, "total_tokens": 2624, "prompt_tokens": 2236, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 303}}, "elapsed_seconds": 4.16}
{"id": 13, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？哪来什么惊天动地的战斗啊，你当是在看什么骑士传奇小说呢。\n我的能力觉醒又没那么夸张，而且都说了挺适合搞恶作剧的，具体细节我才懒得跟你细说。[MSG_BREAK]至于学院第一……哈！你看我像是成天泡在书斋里争第一的那种人吗？理论课那堆破玩意儿看着我就头大。\n不过要是单论剑术或者真刀真枪干一架，哼，我可没觉得自己会随便输给哪个家伙。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 122, "total_tokens": 3946, "prompt_tokens": 2913, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 911}}, "elapsed_seconds": 6.18}
{"id": 14, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "这几个问题我还真没办法给你肯定的答案。[MSG_BREAK]我父母的名字、家里具体做什么生意，还有胸口这道疤到底是怎么来的，目前都还没有查到可靠的记录和出处，这些我不能随便瞎编给你。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 54, "total_tokens": 2593, "prompt_tokens": 2238, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 301}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.94}
{"id": 14, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？查户口呢你？[MSG_BREAK]谁没事把家里人的名字到处乱报啊。而且我家做什么跟你有啥关系，反正我是弗罗汀土生土长的，别的少打听。[MSG_BREAK]至于胸口……哪来的谣言啊？别整天脑补些有的没的行不行，有这闲心不如去操场跑两圈。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 85, "total_tokens": 3317, "prompt_tokens": 2915, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 317}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.72}
