{"id": 23, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "是不是群主都一样，要代码就直接给你写出来。\n\n```python\ndef binary_search_leftmost(nums: list[int], target: int) -> int:\n    left, right = 0, len(nums) - 1\n    result = -1\n    \n    while left <= right:\n        mid = (left + right) // 2\n        if nums[mid] == target:\n            result = mid\n            right = mid - 1  # 命中后继续往左侧区间收缩\n        elif nums[mid] < target:\n            left = mid + 1\n        else:\n            right = mid - 1\n            \n    return result\n\n\n# 示例 1：空数组\nempty_list = []\nprint(f\"空数组查找 5: {binary_search_leftmost(empty_list, 5)}\")  # 输出: -1\n\n# 示例 2：含重复元素（找最左下标）\nduplicates_list = [1, 2, 2, 2, 3, 5]\nprint(f\"重复元素查找 2 的最左下标: {binary_search_leftmost(duplicates_list, 2)}\")  # 输出: 1\nprint(f\"重复元素查找不存在的值 4: {binary_search_leftmost(duplicates_list, 4)}\")    # 输出: -1\n```\n\n[MSG_BREAK]\n核心逻辑就是在遇到等于目标值时，先记录当前下标，再把右边界收缩到 `mid - 1`，继续看左边还有没有相同的数。空数组在初始状态 `left <= right` 就不成立，直接返回 `-1`。你直接拷去跑就行。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 382, "total_tokens": 2992, "prompt_tokens": 2255, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 355}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.68}
